olor:#121212;"><p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Forget about Michael Carric=
k. Don=E2=80=99t dwell on Women=E2=80=99s Bigger Cup. Fret not about Pierre=
 Sage. No, the big football story of the day is <a href=3D"https://ablink.e=
ditorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSne=
HEDom6Up7NBgS48fUZgZf5ceBLKr42K4LHJzFlvuGW4qxCYsoIkB-9Q4xVwJrOTBtTrBovLEhus=
